["Mhla kwehla isehlakalo.","Akekho oyophika ukwehlakala kwaso.","Siyohlazisa [abaphambukile] siphakamise [abathobela u Allah].","Lapho umhlaba uyozanyazanyiswa kanzima.","Nezintaba zisakazwe izicucu.","Zibe ngathi uthuli olusabalele.","Futhi niyoba amaqembu amathathu.","Kunalabo abangakwesokunene; yeka abangakwesokunene!","Futhi kunalabo abangakwesokunxele; yeka abangakwesokunxele!","Futhi nalabo abahamba phambili [ezintweni ezinhle] bayohamba phambili.","Labo bayosondezwa eduze [ku Allah].","Ezivandeni zentokomalo.","[Kuyongena] iqulu kulabo abasekuqaleni.","Nedlanzana kulabo abeze mumva.","Emibhedeni ehlotshiswe ngegolide.","Bayoqhiyama kuyo babhekane.","Bayosetshenzelwa ngabafana abaphila unaphakade.","Bebalethela izinkamba namabikili nezinkomishi zewayini egelezayo.","Ayiphathisani ngekhanda futhi ayidakani.","Nezithelo abazikhethelayo.","Nenyama yezinyoni abayilangazelelayo.","Nama Huri-Ayini [izintombi zaseJana].","Afana nobuhlalu obumhlophe obufihliwe.","Kuwumvuzo walokho ababekwenza.","Abayikuzwa kuzo [izivande] umbhedo noma izimpambuko.","Ngaphandle nje kokuthi, “ukuthula, ukuthula”.","Futhi abangakwesokunene; yeka abangakwesokunene!","Bayohlala phansi kwezihlahla ezingenameva.","Nezikabhanana ezinezixhobo.","Nomthunzi obanzi.","Namanzi aphophomayo.","Nezithelo ezingi.","Ezingapheli futhi ezinganqatshelwe.","Nemibhede ephakeme.","Impela sizidale sizisusa phansi [izintombi zaseJana].","Sazenza izintombi nto.","Ziyathandeka zingontanga.","Sizidalele abangakwesokunene.","Kuyongena kulabo abasekuqaleni.","Nequlu kulabo abakamumva.","Futhi abangakwesokunxele; yeka [usizi] labangakwesokunxele!","Bayongena emoyeni oshisayo nasemanzini abilayo.","Nomthunzi oshisanayo.","Awupholile futhi awumuhle.","Impela ngaphambi kwalokho babephila kamnandi.","Futhi babephikelela ukwenza impambuko enkulu [ukubhangqa uAllah].","Futhi babethi: “Kuyothi lapho sesifile saba inhlabathi namathambo, siphinde sivuswe na?”","Ngisho nokhokho bethu imbala?","Yithi: “Abasendulo nabasekugcineni…”","Bayobuthaniswa bonke ngesikhathi sosuku olubekiwe.","Bese nina enidukile eniphikayo…","Niyodla esihlahleni sameva [izakumi].","Niyogcwalisa izisu ngaso.","Bese nehlisa ngamanzi abilayo.","Niyophuzisa okwekameli elonyiwe.","Iyona lena indawo yabo ngosuku lokwahlulela.","Thina sinidalile, ake nikholwe.","Niyasibona isidoda enisikhiqizayo na?","Ingabe yinina enisidalayo kumbe yithina abadalile na?","Yithina esibeke ukufa phakathi kwenu futhi angeka sahluleka.","Ukuniguqula sinenze lokho eningakwazi.","Futhi niyakwazi ukudalwa kokuqala; pho kungani ningathathi isifundo na?","Ake nibheke lokhu enikutshalayo.","Ingabe yinina enihlumisayo kumbe yithina abahlumisi na?","Uma sithanda besingakwenza kome, nisale nimangele.","Nithi: “Impela sijezisiwe”.","Empeleni asiphiwanga.","Ake nibheke lamanzi eniwaphuzayo.","Ingabe yinina yini eniwehlisayo emafini kumbe yithina abehlisayo na?","Uma sithanda besingawenza ababe; ngakhoke ake nibonge.","Ake nibheke umlilo lona eniwubasayo.","Ingabe yinina enidale isihlahla sawo kumbe yithina abadalile na?","Thina siwenze waba yisikhumbuzo nensiza kuzihambi.","Ngakhoke, dumisa ngeGama leNkosi yakho Enkulu.","Ngifunga ngemizila yezinkanyezi.","Impela isifungo esikhulu ukube niyazi.","Impela iyiKurani ehloniphekile.","Elotshwe eNcwadini evikelwe [Uqwembe olulondoloziwe].","Engathintwa muntu ngaphandle kwalabo abahlanzekile [izingelosi].","Yembulelwe ivela eNkosini yendalo yonke.","Ingabe niphika lamazwi [iKurani] na?","Futhi nazabela ukuthi niphike.","Uma [umphefumulo] usufika emphinjeni…","Kulapho nina nibhekile.","Futhi Thina siseduze kwakhe [umufi] ukudlula nina, kepha aniboni.","Uma ngempela ningezukwahlulela…","Wubuyiseleni emuva [umphefumulo] uma ngempela niqinisile.","Uma [umufi] engowalabo abasondeziwe [ku Allah];","Uyothola ukuphumula nokunethezeka nezivande zentokomalo.","Uma engowaba ngakwesokunene…","Ukuthula kuwe kuvela kwaba ngakwesokunene.","Uma engowalabo abaphikayo abadukile;","Uyohlala emanzini abilayo.","Futhi angene emlilweni.","Impela lokhu yiqiniso elingenakuphikiswa.","Ngakhoke, dumisa ngeGama leNkosi yakho Enkulu."]